{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/bb49b66ac4142be66fce6453fa719cce.avif?t=1759156551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras_big/bb49b66ac4142be66fce6453fa719cce.avif?t=1759156551 width=800 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hungry Gooper swarm threatens intergalactic peace. Stop them! Build towers around planets and take control over their orbits. Spin them with all you\u2019ve attached! Collect new towers, powers and upgrades to beat the onslaught of goopers and save the galaxy in this colorful Tower Defense Roguelite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/718c0ab80e1a5b4584816655fe486250.avif?t=1759156551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras_big/718c0ab80e1a5b4584816655fe486250.avif?t=1759156551 width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/6c729e665de74081a7d79bbbd9547b19.poster.avif?t=1759156551\" width=630 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/6c729e665de74081a7d79bbbd9547b19.webm?t=1759156551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/6c729e665de74081a7d79bbbd9547b19.mp4?t=1759156551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic defense is a good defense. Freely rotate orbits with all the towers you\u2019ve built on them. Reposition your defenses, take control of the battlefield, and spin your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/653abffee868e3ecd083bb4813daf53a.avif?t=1759156551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras_big/653abffee868e3ecd083bb4813daf53a.avif?t=1759156551 width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/82c1230b7e898d5c696f2307d7baee82.poster.avif?t=1759156551\" width=630 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/82c1230b7e898d5c696f2307d7baee82.webm?t=1759156551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/82c1230b7e898d5c696f2307d7baee82.mp4?t=1759156551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build smart. Every encounter throws something new at you \u2014 so bring the right tools: turrets, bombs, and enough lasers to light up the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/ce5dcfa3feb9b506ee94d856b8a7d817.avif?t=1759156551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras_big/ce5dcfa3feb9b506ee94d856b8a7d817.avif?t=1759156551 width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/a4f8e4ab141953538e44c2920e7c7afc.poster.avif?t=1759156551\" width=630 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/a4f8e4ab141953538e44c2920e7c7afc.webm?t=1759156551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/a4f8e4ab141953538e44c2920e7c7afc.mp4?t=1759156551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same \u2014 build your arsenal as you go. Make it efficient, unpredictable, or just plain devastating. Synergy is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/1e7c601e4609307b7aeaabf6de511040.avif?t=1759156551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras_big/1e7c601e4609307b7aeaabf6de511040.avif?t=1759156551 width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/35e1ac132f4037064c4ef0e698f13be9.poster.avif?t=1759156551\" width=630 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/35e1ac132f4037064c4ef0e698f13be9.webm?t=1759156551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/35e1ac132f4037064c4ef0e698f13be9.mp4?t=1759156551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, unlock new possibilities - more towers, powers and characters, each with their own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst